      "text": "像我自己上週也是和\\nmy dear wife大吵了一架……\\r\\n但是我立刻道了歉，然後就和好了！[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
